From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:47:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Serve archive feed from one cached catalogue

Each cursor/filter combination was its own cache entry, so every new page a
shopper scrolled to woke Neon. Cache all visible archive rows once and page
them in memory. Sales of originals no longer clear the archive cache.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015ZfuwBjiBepEqknzKYF5QU
